> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > hrtimer is queued (schedule_arm / vblank_quirk), cleared when the
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > callback runs, and re-set on retry. commit()/vblank_quirk() schedule on
> X-Git-Archeology: > recovered message: > !de->arm_sched, closing the lost-update race under arm_lock.
